{"t":"A good tour guide","l":["在|zài|at / 西安|Xī’ān|Xi’an / ， / 他们|tāmen|they / 有|yǒu|has / 一|yí|one / 个|ge|(measure word) / 导游|dǎoyóu|tour guide / 。 = In Xi’an, they have a tour guide.","导游|dǎoyóu|tour guide / 很|hěn|very / 有|yǒu|has / 礼貌|lǐmào|polite / 。 = The tour guide is very polite.","导游|dǎoyóu|tour guide / 很|hěn|very / 幽默|yōumò|humorous / ， / 也|yě|also / 很|hěn|very / 有|yǒu|has / 耐心|nàixīn|patient / 。 = The tour guide is very humorous, and also very patient.","导游|dǎoyóu|tour guide / ： / 请|qǐng|please / 看|kàn|look / 这里|zhèlǐ|here / 。 = Tour guide: Please look here.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 很|hěn|very / 粗心|cūxīn|careless / ， / 有点儿|yǒudiǎnr|a little / 懒|lǎn|lazy / ， / 他|tā|he / 没有|méiyǒu|do not have / 看|kàn|look / 。 = Daming is careless and a little lazy. He did not look.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ， / 你|nǐ|you / 太|tài|too / 马虎|mǎhu|careless / 了|le|(emphasis) / ！ = Xiao Wen: Daming, you are too sloppy!","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 对不起|duìbuqǐ|sorry / ， / 我|wǒ|I / 看|kàn|look / 一下|yíxià|a little / 。 = Daming: Sorry, I will have a look.","导游|dǎoyóu|tour guide / 笑|xiào|to laugh / 了|le|(completed) / 。 = The tour guide smiled."],"q":[[2,"What is the tour guide like?",["Humorous and patient","Angry and fast","Shy and lazy"],0,"Line 3: 幽默 means humorous and 有耐心 means patient."],[4,"What does Daming not do?",["He does not look","He does not eat","He does not walk"],0,"Line 5: 他没有看 means “he did not look”."]]},
{"t":"On the mountain","l":["他们|tāmen|they / 去|qù|go / 山|shān|mountain / 上|shang|on / 。 / 今天|jīntiān|today / 阳光|yángguāng|sunshine / 很|hěn|very / 好|hǎo|good / 。 = They go up the mountain. The sunshine is good today.","山|shān|mountain / 上|shang|on / 有|yǒu|has / 很|hěn|very / 大|dà|big / 的|de|’s / 森林|sēnlín|forest / 。 = There is a very big forest on the mountain.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 这里|zhèlǐ|here / 的|de|’s / 景色|jǐngsè|scenery / 真|zhēn|really / 好|hǎo|good / ！ = Daming: The scenery here is really good!","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 天|tiān|day / 上|shang|on / 有|yǒu|has / 很多|hěn duō|many / 云|yún|cloud / 。 = Xiao Wen: There are many clouds in the sky.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 今天|jīntiān|today / 不|bù|not / 冷|lěng|cold / ， / 也|yě|also / 不|bú|not / 热|rè|hot / 。 = Xiao Wen: Today is not cold and not hot.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 这里|zhèlǐ|here / 没有|méiyǒu|do not have / 污染|wūrǎn|pollution / 。 = Daming: There is no pollution here.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 喜欢|xǐhuan|like / 大|dà|big / 自然|zìrán|nature / 。 = Xiao Wen: I like nature.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 我们|wǒmen|we / 也|yě|also / 不|bù|not / 能|néng|can / 污染|wūrǎn|pollution / 它|tā|it / 。 = Daming: We must also not pollute it."],"q":[[1,"What is on the mountain?",["A big forest","A big shop","A big river"],0,"Line 2: 很大的森林 means “a very big forest”."],[4,"How is the weather?",["Not cold and not hot","Very hot","Very cold"],0,"Line 5: 不冷，也不热 means “not cold and not hot”."]]},
{"t":"A stomach ache","l":["晚上|wǎnshang|evening / ， / 大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 的|de|’s / 肚子|dùzi|stomach / 疼|téng|to hurt / 。 = In the evening, Daming’s stomach hurts.","他|tā|he / 很|hěn|very / 难受|nánshòu|unwell / ， / 出|chū|to go out / 了|le|(completed) / 很多|hěn duō|many / 汗|hàn|sweat / 。 / 他们|tāmen|they / 去|qù|go / 医院|yīyuàn|hospital / 。 = He feels bad and sweats a lot. They go to the hospital.","医生|yīshēng|doctor / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 吃|chī|eat / 了|le|(completed) / 什么|shénme|what / ？ = Doctor: What did you eat?","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 吃|chī|eat / 了|le|(completed) / 很多|hěn duō|many / 肉|ròu|meat / 。 = Daming: I ate a lot of meat.","护士|hùshi|nurse / ： / 别|bié|do not / 担心|dānxīn|to worry / ， / 我|wǒ|I / 给|gěi|give / 你|nǐ|you / 打针|dǎzhēn|to have an injection / 。 = Nurse: Do not worry. I will give you an injection.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 不|bù|not / 想|xiǎng|want to / 打针|dǎzhēn|to have an injection / ！ = Daming: I do not want an injection!","医生|yīshēng|doctor / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 要|yào|want / 打针|dǎzhēn|to have an injection / ， / 也|yě|also / 要|yào|want / 多|duō|many / 休息|xiūxi|to rest / 。 = Doctor: You need an injection, and you need to rest more.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 现在|xiànzài|now / 没有|méiyǒu|do not have / 力气|lìqi|physical strength / 。 / 睡觉|shuìjiào|to sleep / 就|jiù|then / 好|hǎo|good / 了|le|(change) / 。 = Xiao Wen: You have no strength now. Sleep and you will be fine."],"q":[[3,"What did Daming eat?",["A lot of meat","Many sweets","Only fruit"],0,"Line 4: 很多肉 means “a lot of meat”."],[5,"What does Daming say about the injection?",["He does not want it","He wants it","He is not afraid"],0,"Line 6: 我不想打针 means “I do not want an injection”."]]},
{"t":"Too salty","l":["他们|tāmen|they / 在|zài|at / 一|yì|one / 家|jiā|(measure word for shops and companies) / 饭店|fàndiàn|restaurant / 吃|chī|eat / 饭|fàn|meal / 。 = They eat at a restaurant.","服务员|fúwùyuán|waiter / ： / 你们|nǐmen|you (plural) / 想|xiǎng|want to / 吃|chī|eat / 什么|shénme|what / ？ = Waiter: What would you like to eat?","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 要|yào|want / 一|yì|one / 碗|wǎn|bowl / 汤|tāng|soup / 。 = Xiao Wen: I want a bowl of soup.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 这|zhè|this / 个|ge|(measure word) / 汤|tāng|soup / 太|tài|too / 咸|xián|salty / 了|le|(emphasis) / ！ = Xiao Wen: This soup is too salty!","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 请|qǐng|please / 给|gěi|give / 她|tā|she / 一|yì|one / 杯|bēi|cups / 水|shuǐ|water / 。 = Daming: Please give her a glass of water.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 不|bù|not / 吃|chī|eat / 辣|là|spicy / 的|de|(nominaliser) / ， / 也|yě|also / 不|bù|not / 吃|chī|eat / 酸|suān|sour / 的|de|(nominaliser) / 。 = Xiao Wen: I do not eat spicy things, and I do not eat sour things.","服务员|fúwùyuán|waiter / ： / 这|zhè|this / 个|ge|(measure word) / 菜|cài|dish / 的|de|’s / 味道|wèidào|taste / 很|hěn|very / 好|hǎo|good / 。 = Waiter: This dish tastes very good.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 这|zhè|this / 个|ge|(measure word) / 菜|cài|dish / 有点儿|yǒudiǎnr|a little / 苦|kǔ|bitter / ， / 但是|dànshì|but / 很|hěn|very / 香|xiāng|tasting or smelling good / 。 = Daming: This dish is a little bitter, but it smells good."],"q":[[3,"What is wrong with the soup?",["It is too salty","It is too sour","It is cold"],0,"Line 4: 太咸了 means “too salty”."],[7,"How is the last dish?",["A little bitter but smells good","Very sweet","Too spicy"],0,"Line 8: 有点儿苦，但是很香."]]},
{"t":"Street snacks","l":["晚上|wǎnshang|evening / ， / 他们|tāmen|they / 去|qù|go / 买|mǎi|buy / 小吃|xiǎochī|snack / 。 = In the evening, they go to buy snacks.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 想|xiǎng|want to / 吃|chī|eat / 烤鸭|kǎoyā|roast duck / 。 = Daming: I want to eat roast duck.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 要|yào|want / 两|liǎng|two / 个|ge|(measure word) / 包子|bāozi|steamed bun / 和|hé|and / 十|shí|ten / 个|ge|(measure word) / 饺子|jiǎozi|dumpling / 。 = Xiao Wen: I want two steamed buns and ten dumplings.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 葡萄|pútao|grape / 很|hěn|very / 甜|tián|sweet / 。 = Xiao Wen: The grapes are sweet.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 要|yào|want / 一|yì|one / 杯|bēi|cups / 果汁|guǒzhī|fruit juice / 。 = Daming: I want a glass of juice.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 给|gěi|give / 大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 一|yì|one / 瓶|píng|bottle / 矿泉水|kuàngquánshuǐ|mineral water / 。 = Xiao Wen gives Daming a bottle of mineral water.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 谢谢|xièxie|thank you / ！ = Daming: Thank you!","他们|tāmen|they / 吃|chī|eat / 得|de|(link) / 很|hěn|very / 高兴|gāoxìng|happy / 。 = They enjoyed eating very much."],"q":[[1,"What does Daming want to eat?",["Roast duck","Dumplings","Noodles"],0,"Line 2: 想吃烤鸭 means “want to eat roast duck”."],[5,"What does Xiao Wen give Daming?",["A bottle of mineral water","A glass of juice","A box of biscuits"],0,"Line 6: 一瓶矿泉水."]]},
{"t":"A haircut","l":["大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 的|de|’s / 头发|tóufa|hair / 很|hěn|very / 长|cháng|long / ， / 他|tā|he / 想|xiǎng|want to / 去|qù|go / 理发|lǐfà|to have a haircut / 。 = Daming’s hair is very long, and he wants to have a haircut.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 的|de|’s / 眼镜|yǎnjìng|glasses / 在|zài|at / 哪儿|nǎr|where / ？ = Xiao Wen: Where are your glasses?","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 在|zài|at / 桌子|zhuōzi|table / 上|shang|on / 。 = Daming: On the table.","他|tā|he / 戴|dài|to wear (hat) / 上|shàng|on / 眼镜|yǎnjìng|glasses / ， / 去|qù|go / 理发|lǐfà|to have a haircut / 。 = He puts on his glasses and goes to have a haircut.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 在|zài|at / 家|jiā|home / 洗|xǐ|to wash / 袜子|wàzi|sock / 和|hé|with / 毛巾|máojīn|towel / 。 = Xiao Wen washes socks and towels at home.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 回来|huílái|come back / 了|le|(completed) / ， / 头发|tóufa|hair / 很|hěn|very / 短|duǎn|short / 。 = Daming came back, and his hair is very short.","他|tā|he / 脱|tuō|to take off / 了|le|(completed) / 衣服|yīfu|clothes / ， / 把|bǎ|(object marker) / 塑料袋|sùliàodài|plastic bag / 放|fàng|put / 在|zài|at / 垃圾桶|lājītǒng|rubbish bin / 里|li|inside / 。 = He took off his clothes and put the plastic bag in the bin.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 戴|dài|to wear (hat) / 着|zhe|(state) / 眼镜|yǎnjìng|glasses / ， / 真|zhēn|really / 好看|hǎokàn|nice-looking / 。 = Xiao Wen: You are wearing glasses, and you look really good."],"q":[[2,"Where are Daming’s glasses?",["On the table","In the bag","At the door"],0,"Line 3: 在桌子上 means “on the table”."],[3,"Where does Daming go?",["To have a haircut","To the bank","To the park"],0,"Line 4: 去理发 means “go to have a haircut”."]]},
{"t":"Messages","l":["小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 想|xiǎng|want to / 给|gěi|give / 妈妈|māma|mum / 发|fā|send / 短信|duǎnxìn|text message / 。 = Xiao Wen wants to send a text message to Mum.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 妈妈|māma|mum / ， / 我们|wǒmen|we / 很|hěn|very / 好|hǎo|good / 。 = Xiao Wen: Mum, we are well.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 要|yào|want / 打印|dǎyìn|to print / 登机牌|dēngjīpái|boarding pass / 吗|ma|(question) / ？ = Daming: Do you need to print the boarding pass?","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 要|yào|want / 。 / 去|qù|go / 这个|zhège|this / 网站|wǎngzhàn|website / 打印|dǎyìn|to print / 。 = Xiao Wen: Yes. Print it on this website.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 帮|bāng|help / 我|wǒ|I / 复印|fùyìn|to photocopy / 一下|yíxià|a little / 吧|ba|(suggestion) / 。 = Daming: Photocopy this for me.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 现在|xiànzài|now / 大家|dàjiā|everyone / 都|dōu|all / 用|yòng|use / 互联网|hùliánwǎng|internet / 。 = Xiao Wen: Now everyone uses the internet.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 看|kàn|look / ， / 有|yǒu|has / 一|yì|one / 条|tiáo|(measure word) / 新|xīn|new / 消息|xiāoxi|news / 。 = Daming: Look, there is a new message."],"q":[[0,"Who does Xiao Wen send a text message to?",["Mum","Daming","Teacher Li"],0,"Line 1: 给妈妈发短信 means “send a text message to Mum”."],[2,"What does Daming ask about printing?",["The boarding pass","The visa","The photo"],0,"Line 3: 打印登机牌 means “print the boarding pass”."]]},
{"t":"Back in class","l":["他们|tāmen|they / 回|huí|return / 到|dào|to / 北京|Běijīng|Beijing / 了|le|(completed) / 。 = They have come back to Beijing.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 欢迎|huānyíng|welcome / 回来|huílái|back / ！ / 今天|jīntiān|today / 我们|wǒmen|we / 学|xué|study / 语法|yǔfǎ|grammar / 。 = Teacher Li: Welcome back! Today we study grammar.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 请|qǐng|please / 看|kàn|look / 第|dì|(ordinal) / 五|wǔ|five / 页|yè|page / 。 = Teacher Li: Please look at page five.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 请|qǐng|please / 填空|tiánkòng|to fill in the blank / 。 = Teacher Li: Please fill in the blanks.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 老师|lǎoshī|teacher / ， / 这|zhè|this / 个|ge|(measure word) / 题|tí|question / 的|de|’s / 答案|dá’àn|answer / 是|shì|is / 什么|shénme|what / ？ = Xiao Wen: Teacher, what is the answer to this question?","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 这|zhè|this / 个|ge|(measure word) / 故事|gùshi|story / ， / 请|qǐng|please / 你们|nǐmen|you (plural) / 翻译|fānyì|to translate / 成|chéng|into / 英文|Yīngwén|English / 。 = Teacher Li: Please translate this story into English.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 每天|měitiān|every day / 阅读|yuèdú|to read / ， / 所以|suǒyǐ|so / 不|bú|not / 太|tài|too / 难|nán|difficult / 。 = Xiao Wen: I read every day, so it is not too difficult."],"q":[[2,"Which page does Teacher Li ask them to look at?",["Page five","Page three","Page ten"],0,"Line 3: 第五页 means page five."],[5,"What do they translate?",["A story","A letter","A form"],0,"Line 6: 这个故事 means “this story”."]]}
