{"t":"Sorry, I am late","l":["小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 来|lái|come / 晚|wǎn|late / 了|le|(completed) / ， / 老师|lǎoshī|teacher / 在|zài|at / 上课|shàngkè|have class / 。 = Xiao Wen is late, and the teacher is in class.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 对不起|duìbuqǐ|sorry / ， / 我|wǒ|I / 迟到|chídào|to be late / 了|le|(completed) / ！ = Xiao Wen: Sorry, I am late!","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 课|kè|class / 上|shang|on / 不|bù|not / 允许|yǔnxǔ|to allow / 迟到|chídào|to be late / 。 = Teacher Li: Being late is not allowed in class.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 要|yào|want / 向|xiàng|towards / 您|nín|you (polite) / 道歉|dàoqiàn|to apologise / 。 = Xiao Wen: I must apologise to you.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 好|hǎo|good / ， / 我|wǒ|I / 原谅|yuánliàng|to forgive / 你|nǐ|you / ， / 请|qǐng|please / 进|jìn|to enter / 。 = Teacher Li: OK, I forgive you. Please come in.","下课|xiàkè|finish class / 后|hòu|back / ， / 大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 对|duì|to / 小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 打招呼|dǎ zhāohu|to greet / 。 = After class, Daming greets Xiao Wen.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 要|yào|want / 请|qǐng|please / 我|wǒ|I / 吃|chī|eat / 饭|fàn|meal / 吗|ma|(question) / ？ / 我|wǒ|I / 是|shì|is / 开玩笑|kāi wánxiào|to joke / 的|de|’s / 。 = Daming: Will you invite me to a meal? I am joking.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 不|bú|not / 会|huì|will / 拒绝|jùjué|to refuse / ！ = Xiao Wen: I will not refuse!"],"q":[[0,"Why does Xiao Wen say sorry?",["She is late","She is ill","She lost her key"],0,"Line 1: 来晚了 means “came late”."],[4,"What does Teacher Li say to Xiao Wen?",["I forgive you","Go home","Wait outside"],0,"Line 5: 我原谅你 means “I forgive you”."]]},
{"t":"Safety rules","l":["学校|xuéxiào|school / 有|yǒu|has / 很多|hěn duō|many / 规定|guīdìng|rule / 。 = The school has many rules.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / 对|duì|to / 学生|xuésheng|student / 很|hěn|very / 严格|yángé|strict / 。 = Teacher Li is strict with students.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 在|zài|at / 路上|lùshang|on the road / ， / 要|yào|want / 注意|zhùyì|to pay attention / 安全|ānquán|safe / 。 = Teacher Li: On the road, pay attention to safety.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 这里|zhèlǐ|here / 很|hěn|very / 危险|wēixiǎn|dangerous / 。 = Daming: It is dangerous here.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 保证|bǎozhèng|to promise / 不|bù|not / 跑|pǎo|run / 。 = Xiao Wen: I promise not to run.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 这|zhè|this / 是|shì|is / 正式|zhèngshì|formal / 的|de|’s / 规定|guīdìng|rule / 。 = Teacher Li: This is an official rule.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 如果|rúguǒ|if / 不|bú|not / 注意|zhùyì|to pay attention / ， / 问题|wèntí|question / 会|huì|will / 很|hěn|very / 严重|yánzhòng|serious / 。 = Daming: If we do not pay attention, the problem will be serious.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 我们|wǒmen|we / 要|yào|want / 保护|bǎohù|to protect / 自己|zìjǐ|oneself / 。 = Teacher Li: We must protect ourselves."],"q":[[2,"What does Teacher Li say to pay attention to?",["Safety","Time","Money"],0,"Line 3: 注意安全 means “pay attention to safety”."],[4,"What does Xiao Wen promise?",["Not to run","To come early","To study more"],0,"Line 5: 我保证不跑 means “I promise not to run”."]]},
{"t":"A broken phone","l":["小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 的|de|’s / 手机|shǒujī|mobile phone / 坏|huài|broken / 了|le|(completed) / 。 = Xiao Wen’s phone is broken.","她|tā|she / 去|qù|go / 商店|shāngdiàn|shop / ， / 商店|shāngdiàn|shop / 里|li|inside / 的|de|’s / 顾客|gùkè|customer / 很多|hěn duō|many / 。 = She goes to a shop. There are many customers in the shop.","售货员|shòuhuòyuán|shop assistant / ： / 你|nǐ|you / 的|de|’s / 手机|shǒujī|mobile phone / 要|yào|want / 修理|xiūlǐ|to repair / 。 = Shop assistant: Your phone needs repair.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 那|nà|that / 我|wǒ|I / 买|mǎi|buy / 一|yì|one / 台|tái|(measure word for machines) / 新|xīn|new / 的|de|’s / 。 = Xiao Wen: Then I will buy a new one.","售货员|shòuhuòyuán|shop assistant / ： / 这|zhè|this / 台|tái|(measure word for machines) / 的|de|’s / 质量|zhìliàng|quality / 很|hěn|very / 好|hǎo|good / 。 = Shop assistant: The quality of this one is very good.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 不|bù|not / 会|huì|know how to / 用|yòng|use / 。 = Xiao Wen: I do not know how to use it.","售货员|shòuhuòyuán|shop assistant / ： / 这|zhè|this / 个|ge|(measure word) / 颜色|yánsè|colour / 适合|shìhé|to suit / 你|nǐ|you / ， / 大小|dàxiǎo|size / 也|yě|also / 合适|héshì|suitable / 。 = Shop assistant: This colour suits you, and the size is also right.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 好|hǎo|good / ， / 我|wǒ|I / 买|mǎi|buy / 。 = Xiao Wen: OK, I will buy it."],"q":[[2,"What does the shop assistant say about the old phone?",["It needs repair","It is new","It is free"],0,"Line 3: 要修理 means “needs repair”."],[3,"What does Xiao Wen decide?",["To buy a new one","To go home","To ask Daming"],0,"Line 4: 我买一台新的 means “I will buy a new one”."]]},
{"t":"How many students?","l":["李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 我们|wǒmen|we / 班|bān|class (a group of students) / 有|yǒu|has / 三十|sānshí|thirty / 个|ge|(measure word) / 学生|xuésheng|student / 。 = Teacher Li: Our class has thirty students.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 百分之|bǎi fēn zhī|percent / 六十|liùshí|sixty / 是|shì|is / 女|nǚ|female / 学生|xuésheng|student / 。 = Daming: Sixty percent are female students.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 今年|jīnnián|this year / 的|de|’s / 学生|xuésheng|student / 大约|dàyuē|about / 是|shì|is / 去年|qùnián|last year / 的|de|’s / 两|liǎng|two / 倍|bèi|times / 。 = Xiao Wen: This year’s students are about twice last year’s.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 学生|xuésheng|student / 都|dōu|all / 来|lái|come / 了|le|(completed) / 。 = Teacher Li: The students have all come.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 这|zhè|this / 一|yí|one / 部分|bùfen|part / 我|wǒ|I / 全部|quánbù|all / 懂|dǒng|to understand / 。 = Xiao Wen: I understand all of this part.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 许多|xǔduō|many / 人|rén|person / 八|bā|eight / 点|diǎn|o’clock / 左右|zuǒyòu|about / 到|dào|to / 。 = Daming: Many people arrived at about eight.","李老师|Lǐ lǎoshī|Teacher Li / ： / 一切|yíqiè|everything / 都|dōu|all / 很|hěn|very / 顺利|shùnlì|smooth / 。 = Teacher Li: Everything is going smoothly.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 老师|lǎoshī|teacher / ， / 你|nǐ|you / 大概|dàgài|probably / 几|jǐ|how many / 点|diǎn|o’clock / 下课|xiàkè|finish class / ？ = Xiao Wen: Teacher, about what time does class finish?"],"q":[[0,"How many students are in the class?",["Thirty","Ten","One hundred"],0,"Line 1: 有三十个学生 means “has thirty students”."],[1,"What percent are female students?",["Sixty percent","Ten percent","Ninety percent"],0,"Line 2: 百分之六十 means sixty percent."]]}
