{"t":"Ordering food","l":["大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 和|hé|with / 小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 去|qù|go / 饭店|fàndiàn|restaurant / 。 = Daming and Xiao Wen go to a restaurant.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 我|wǒ|I / 要|yào|want / 一|yí|one / 份|fèn|(measure word for portions) / 饺子|jiǎozi|dumpling / 。 = Daming: I want one portion of dumplings.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 我们|wǒmen|we / 俩|liǎ|two / 要|yào|want / 两|liǎng|two / 份|fèn|(measure word for portions) / 。 = Xiao Wen: We two want two portions.","服务员|fúwùyuán|waiter / ： / 一|yí|one / 份|fèn|(measure word for portions) / 十|shí|ten / 块|kuài|yuan / 五|wǔ|five / 。 = Waiter: One portion is 10.5 yuan.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 昨天|zuótiān|yesterday / 有|yǒu|has / 一|yì|one / 场|chǎng|(measure word for matches) / 比赛|bǐsài|match / ， / 我|wǒ|I / 去|qù|go / 了|le|(completed) / 一|yí|one / 趟|tàng|(measure word for trips) / 学校|xuéxiào|school / 。 = Daming: Yesterday there was a match, and I went to the school once.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 请|qǐng|please / 再|zài|again / 说|shuō|say / 一|yí|one / 遍|biàn|(measure word for full repetitions) / 。 = Xiao Wen: Please say it once more.","大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 学校|xuéxiào|school / 旁边|pángbiān|beside / 有|yǒu|has / 一|yí|one / 座|zuò|(measure word for mountains) / 山|shān|mountain / ， / 山|shān|mountain / 上|shang|on / 有|yǒu|has / 三|sān|three / 棵|kē|(measure word for trees) / 树|shù|tree / 。 = Daming: Beside the school there is a mountain, and there are three trees on it.","小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 今天|jīntiān|today / 三十|sānshí|thirty / 度|dù|degree / ， / 我们|wǒmen|we / 去|qù|go / 看|kàn|look / 看|kàn|look / 吧|ba|(suggestion) / 。 = Xiao Wen: Today it is thirty degrees. Let us go and look."],"q":[[2,"How many portions do they order?",["Two","One","Ten"],0,"Line 3: 两份 means two portions."],[7,"What is the temperature today?",["Thirty degrees","Ten degrees","Three degrees"],0,"Line 8: 三十度 means thirty degrees."]]}
