  "他|tā|he / 走|zǒu|to walk, to leave / 了|le|(completed) / ， / 我|wǒ|I, me / 去|qù|to go / 跑步|pǎobù|to jog, to run / 。 = He has left, and I am going jogging.",
  "我|wǒ|I, me / 正在|zhèngzài|in the middle of (doing) / 找|zhǎo|to look for / 我|wǒ|I, me / 的|de|’s / 书|shū|book / 。 = I am looking for my book.",
