  "这个|zhège|this / 饭店|fàndiàn|restaurant / 的|de|’s / 面条|miàntiáo|noodles / 很|hěn|very / 好吃|hǎochī|tasty (food) / 。 = The noodles at this restaurant are very tasty.",
