  "今天|jīntiān|today / 很|hěn|very / 热|rè|hot / ， / 我|wǒ|I, me / 想|xiǎng|to want to, to think / 吃|chī|to eat / 西瓜|xīguā|watermelon / 。 = It is hot today, and I want to eat watermelon.",
