  "这个|zhège|this / 手表|shǒubiǎo|watch / 很|hěn|very / 便宜|piányi|cheap / ， / 我|wǒ|I, me / 想|xiǎng|to want to, to think / 买|mǎi|to buy / 。 = This watch is very cheap, and I want to buy it.",
