  "北京|Běijīng|Beijing / 的|de|’s / 冬天|dōngtiān|winter / 很|hěn|very / 冷|lěng|cold / ， / 常常|chángcháng|often / 下雪|xià xuě|to snow / 。 = Winter in Beijing is very cold, and it often snows.",
  "我|wǒ|I, me / 喜欢|xǐhuan|to like / 春天|chūntiān|spring / ， / 不|bù|not / 喜欢|xǐhuan|to like / 夏天|xiàtiān|summer / 。 = I like spring, and I do not like summer.",
