 "我|wǒ|I, me / 每|měi|every / 天|tiān|day / 早上|zǎoshang|early morning / 刷牙|shuāyá|to brush teeth / 。 = I brush my teeth every morning.",
 "我|wǒ|I, me / 的|de|’s / 爱好|àihào|hobby / 是|shì|to be / 看|kàn|to look / 书|shū|book / 。 = My hobby is reading.",
