 "大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / ： / 它|tā|it / 很|hěn|very / 聪明|cōngming|clever / 吗|ma|(yes/no question) / ？ = Daming: Is it clever?",
 "小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 对|duì|yes / 啊|a|(softener) / ， / 它|tā|it / 很|hěn|very / 聪明|cōngming|clever / 。 = Xiao Wen: Yes, it is clever.",
 "小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 的|de|’s / 家|jiā|home, family / 很|hěn|very / 干净|gānjìng|clean / ， / 也|yě|also / 很|hěn|very / 安静|ānjìng|quiet / 。 = Xiao Wen’s home is clean and also quiet.",
 "大明|Dàmíng|Daming (name) / 又|yòu|again, also / 来|lái|to come / 小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 家|jiā|home, family / 了|le|(completed) / 。 = Daming has come to Xiao Wen’s home again.",
