 "小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 去|qù|to go / 商店|shāngdiàn|shop / 买|mǎi|to buy / 衣服|yīfu|clothes / 。 = Xiao Wen goes to the shop to buy clothes.",
 "她|tā|she / 买|mǎi|to buy / 了|le|(completed) / 一|yí|one / 件|jiàn|(measure word for clothes) / 蓝|lán|blue / 衬衫|chènshān|shirt / 和|hé|and / 一|yì|one / 条|tiáo|(measure word for long things) / 黑|hēi|black / 裤子|kùzi|trousers / 。 = She bought a blue shirt and a pair of black trousers.",
 "小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / ： / 这|zhè|this / 条|tiáo|(measure word for long things) / 裤子|kùzi|trousers / 多少|duōshao|how much, how many / 钱|qián|money / ？ = Xiao Wen: How much are these trousers?",
 "王阿姨|Wáng āyí|Auntie Wang (shop owner) / ： / 一|yì|one / 百|bǎi|hundred / 块|kuài|yuan (spoken) / 。 = Auntie Wang: One hundred yuan.",
 "小文|Xiǎo Wén|Xiao Wen (name) / 还|hái|still / 买|mǎi|to buy / 了|le|(completed) / 一|yí|one / 条|tiáo|(measure word) / 绿|lǜ|green / 裙子|qúnzi|skirt / 。 = Xiao Wen also bought a green skirt.",
