 "北京|Běijīng|Beijing / 的|de|’s / 冬天|dōngtiān|winter / 特别|tèbié|especially, special / 冷|lěng|cold / 。 = Winter in Beijing is especially cold.",
 "这|zhè|this / 件|jiàn|(measure word for clothes) / 衣服|yīfu|clothes / 比较|bǐjiào|rather, relatively / 便宜|piányi|cheap / 。 = This piece of clothing is rather cheap.",
 "王阿姨|Wáng āyí|Auntie Wang (shop owner) / 的|de|’s / 水果|shuǐguǒ|fruit / 很|hěn|very / 新鲜|xīnxiān|fresh / 。 = Auntie Wang’s fruit is fresh.",
 "李|Lǐ|Li (family name) / 老师|lǎoshī|teacher / 很|hěn|very / 热情|rèqíng|warm, friendly / 。 = Teacher Li is very friendly.",
