"你|nǐ|you / 住|zhù|stay / 在|zài|at / 哪里|nǎlǐ|where / ？ = Where are you staying?",
"请|qǐng|please / 看|kàn|look / 这里|zhèlǐ|here / 。 = Please look here. (at the camera)",
