local:[["师傅","shīfu","master (polite word for drivers and workers)","Locals call taxi drivers 师傅."],["请问","qǐngwèn","excuse me, may I ask","Use it before a question to a stranger."],["那个","nèige","um (literally “that”)","A filler while you think. Very common."],["安检","ānjiǎn","security check","Metro stations have one. Put your bag on the belt."],["打车","dǎchē","take a taxi","Used for hailing a taxi, also with the DiDi app."]],
